## Why ShareAlike, specifically

This is not a free choice. Our derived smoke-PM2.5 extracts are based on the
Stanford ECHOLab daily 10 km smoke PM2.5 dataset, which is published on Harvard
Dataverse under CC BY-SA 4.0. ShareAlike propagates to derivative datasets, so
any redistribution of our processed data must carry the same license and
attribution.

